---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Peter Fornasiero | AI Agent Builder & Software Engineer">
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-24">
		<!-- Header / Nav -->
		<nav class="flex justify-start gap-8 mb-16 text-lg font-medium">
			<a
				href="https://github.com/pforn"
				target="_blank"
				class="hover:text-forest transition-colors no-underline border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-forest pb-1"
				>GitHub</a
			>
			<a
				href="https://linkedin.com/in/peterfornasiero"
				target="_blank"
				class="hover:text-forest transition-colors no-underline border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-forest pb-1"
				>LinkedIn</a
			>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero / Intro -->
		<section class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-12 mb-24">
			<div class="flex-1">
				<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tight">
					Peter Fornasiero
				</h1>
				<p
					class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl"
				>
					I'm a software engineer that was lucky enough to be able to
					learn the fundamentals of computer science, cloud economics,
					security, and scaling laws without LLMs being the default
					answer.
				</p>
				<p
					class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl"
				>
					I feel very fortunate to have been given a great foundation
					of knowledge, endless curiousity, and problem solving skills
					to be able to apply them to the <strong>application</strong>
					of LLMs in various engineering contexts, but more practical business
					contexts as well.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div
				class="w-48 h-48 md:w-64 md:h-64 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-forest flex-shrink-0 shadow-lg border-4 border-forest"
			>
				<img
					src="/peter_fornasiero_profile_placeholder.png"
					alt="Peter Fornasiero"
					class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
				/>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Project Blurbs -->
		<section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-24">
			<div class="border-l-4 border-forest pl-6 py-2">
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="text-forest">/</span> Self-hosted Infrastructure
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Maintaining a containerized home infrastructure orchestrated
					with Docker Compose and routed via Cloudflare + nginx. A
					recent highlight was the environmental engineering for the <strong
						>macro-insight-engine</strong
					>, bridging complex dependency management with highly
					scalable analytical workflows.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="border-l-4 border-forest pl-6 py-2">
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
					<span class="text-forest">/</span> AI Agents
				</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					Developing production-ready agents using <strong
						>Claude 3.5</strong
					>, <strong>OpenRouter</strong>, and <strong
						>LangGraph</strong
					>. My work focuses on outcome-driven automation—from
					predictive modeling for sports analytics on <strong
						>MiroFish</strong
					> to high-throughput data processing pipelines.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer
			class="pt-12 border-t border-gray-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6"
		>
			<p class="text-gray-500 font-medium">© 2026 Peter Fornasiero</p>
			<div class="flex gap-8">
				<a
					href="https://github.com/pforn"
					class="text-gray-400 hover:text-forest transition-colors"
					>GitHub</a
				>
				<a
					href="https://linkedin.com/in/peterfornasiero"
					class="text-gray-400 hover:text-forest transition-colors"
					>LinkedIn</a
				>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	/* Subtle entrance animation */
	main {
		animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
	}

	@keyframes fadeIn {
		from {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateY(10px);
		}
		to {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}
	}
</style>
